{"id":"d7aec2ae249e1a21","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Preservation Instance","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance — ZFC Forcing3 Preservation Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance — ZFC Forcing3 Preservation Instance","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md]]","[[58-df-generic-filter]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance — ZFC Forcing3 Preservation Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52c60ab550f6f214\" href=\"?note=52c60ab550f6f214\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"58-df-generic-filter\">58-df-generic-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> are the predicates and terms from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S\\)</span> is the five-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\Psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Psi)=\\emptyset\\land\\forall G,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb P)\\to\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\{\\Psi\\})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\Psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Psi)=\\emptyset\\land\\forall G,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb P)\\to\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\{\\Psi\\})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> is an explicit set-sized collection of forcing notions; no class-valued Boolean function is hidden in the signature.</li>\n<li>Preservation is evaluated in every generic extension, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> is required to be an object-language sentence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"52c60ab550f6f214","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-filter","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3PreservationInstance}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal L,\\Psi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\Psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\Psi)=\\emptyset\\land\\forall G,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb P)\\to\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\{\\Psi\\})\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2080","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-preservation-instance]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["52c60ab550f6f214","85bf4cca0e5f1662","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}